{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1067337-cocaine-left-in-the-hedge","id":1067337,"title":"Cocaine left in the Hedge","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-03-23T20:09:25-07:00","id":1067337,"title":"Cocaine left in the Hedge","content":"So that happen last game. They left a block of cocaine in the Hedge. What effect should this do to the drug?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4045-princeofcincinnati","name":"princeofcincinnati","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4045_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"95"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-23T22:00:37-07:00","id":1067403,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>princeofcincinnati</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1067337-cocaine-left-in-the-hedge#post1067337\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So that happen last game. They left a block of cocaine in the Hedge. What effect should this do to the drug?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> It should be hurled into the fires of Mordor before anybody snorts it!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-23T22:56:54-07:00","id":1067422,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>princeofcincinnati</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1067337-cocaine-left-in-the-hedge#post1067337\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So that happen last game. They left a block of cocaine in the Hedge. What effect should this do to the drug?</div> </div> </div> </div>Where in the Hedge did they leave it and to what purpose?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-24T04:53:28-07:00","id":1067502,"title":"","content":"It depends on how long the cocaine is left there. The usual course of events is that items left in the Hedge eventually become tokens, but there aren't anything like solid rules for how long it takes or what effect the token has. Especially as a limited use item it's less likely to become a token with a dot rating as opposed to a trifle (essentially a limited use 0 dot token)<br /> <br /> Another important question, how well did they hide it? There's every possibility of it being consumed by a hobgoblin or winding up in a merchants stall at goblin market.<br /> <br /> If you just want to apply a magical property, I would suggest that it ensorcells mortals, allowing them to see through Masks for a week. Changelings already react poorly to many kinds of drugs, it would probably inflict a nasty clarity breaking point.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5328-helmsderp","name":"HelmsDerp","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"652"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-24T06:48:40-07:00","id":1067546,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1067337-cocaine-left-in-the-hedge?p=1067422#post1067422\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Where in the Hedge did they leave it and to what purpose?</div> </div> </div> </div>Are there different sections of Hedge? Changeling isn't my... most indulged in gameline.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11102-necrophear","name":"Necrophear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11102_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-24T07:19:43-07:00","id":1067560,"title":"","content":"I'd imagine something like this.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/37CmQTFJ090\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/37CmQTFJ090\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/37CmQTFJ090\" target=\"_blank\"> https://youtu.be/37CmQTFJ090 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13063-lord-jub-jub","name":"Lord Jub-Jub","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13063_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"121"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-24T09:01:13-07:00","id":1067625,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Necrophear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1067337-cocaine-left-in-the-hedge?p=1067546#post1067546\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are there different sections of Hedge?</div> </div> </div> </div>The Hedge is not a big undifferentiated chunk of trails and thorns and thus the features of a given location within it are going to vary wildly as a whole. Tossing a bag of coke in a river-witch's millpond is likely to produce different results from burying it in a potter's grave at a ramshackle cemetery, and neither of those will have the same result as leaving it on the table at a goblin market or in the middle of the path from here to there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-24T18:30:40-07:00","id":1067880,"title":"","content":"I think maybe it would get into the soil and create a new goblin fruit or it would wind up being mixed with a goblin fruit and turned into a new super drug. If you use the former you could have fun creating the mechanics of the new fruit and if you chose the later maybe a enemy motley starts selling that drug and risks bringing unwanted attention to the freehold.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2015-inspectorjavert","name":"inspectorjavert","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"38"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-24T20:12:57-07:00","id":1067899,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>inspectorjavert</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1067337-cocaine-left-in-the-hedge?p=1067880#post1067880\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think maybe it would get into the soil and create a new goblin fruit or it would wind up being mixed with a goblin fruit and turned into a new super drug. If you use the former you could have fun creating the mechanics of the new fruit and if you chose the later maybe a enemy motley starts selling that drug and risks bringing unwanted attention to the freehold.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> What would the super drug's name be, though?<br /> <br /> Pixie Dust? Because you will literally fly out the god damn window!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-24T20:39:54-07:00","id":1067909,"title":"","content":"&quot;Wyrd-tainted cocaine is a HELL of a drug!&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/12.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div> &quot;A free society is one in which it is safe to be unpopular.&quot;<br /> <span style=\"color:DarkRed\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Comic Sans MS\">I find <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;q=&amp;esrc=s&amp;source=web&amp;cd=3&amp;cad=rja&amp;uact=8&amp;ved=0ahUKEwin4NXQzLfXAhVGySYKHV3TDXYQFgg3MAI&amp;url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.ign.com%2Farticles%2F2017%2F04%2F25%2Fmarvels-nick-spencer-on-captain-americas-betrayal-and-handling-fan-reactions&amp;usg=AOvVaw2EcsX7n5ebntygb0TizyGl\" target=\"_blank\">Nick Spencer</a> and <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;q=&amp;esrc=s&amp;source=web&amp;cd=4&amp;cad=rja&amp;uact=8&amp;ved=0ahUKEwiK7d7szLfXAhXCWSYKHTpKBbcQFgg4MAM&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fen.wikipedia.org%2Fwiki%2FRichard_B._Spencer&amp;usg=AOvVaw1tuP6phfINia-bh_jWsDT_\" target=\"_blank\">Richard Spencer</a> to be equally repulsive.</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6138-mangle77","name":"Mangle77","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6138_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-25T08:21:19-07:00","id":1068014,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1067337-cocaine-left-in-the-hedge?p=1067625#post1067625\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Hedge is not a big undifferentiated chunk of trails and thorns &lt;SNIP&gt;.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fair enough. My only experience in/with it was as a half-unconscious priest; I avoid Changeling because of some issues at my table.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11102-necrophear","name":"Necrophear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11102_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-26T12:38:08-07:00","id":1068375,"title":"","content":"&quot;All right, all right. Enough of the screaming. 'Oh, there's a hobgoblin in my room! Help! Help!' If I wanted to eat your face, I'd've done it when you slept, you shrill voiced idiot. So no more of that! What I need you to do now is take this vile thing you just left to plague us! Take it and leave us in peace? Do you know what this did? DO YOU? My mate, Galthrag, he went and took a sniff of this vile stuff, he did. Looks dazed a sec, then looks around all squinty like and declares 'This makes no sense'. Next thing I know, Galthrag is goin around calling himself 'Bob' wearing a suit like and all. Quites ambushing folk in the wood to skin em alive. Now he spends his daze in the mortal world, sitting at some infernal mortal machine 'accountingating' or some such madness. Comes back with a loaf of what he insists is bread, except this stuff is ground up grain and not the bones of dead english men. Just the other day he's in the gob market trying to buy a trinket, and I keep tellin him the price is three whispers of a spider sung to mortal child as it dreams. And he blows up at me, waves some exotic looking green mortal paper in my face with pictures of numbers and old buildings and some dead mortals on em and insists he use that to pay. And I tells him the price is the price, and he demands to see my 'manager' whatever in the Fairy that is, and when I says we don't have none of those he says that he'll see me in court. He knows damn well I don't trek none with the Changeling Courts and he shouldn't be mucking in their affairs none either! You take it back! Driven him mad, you have!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":14}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2244-nothri","name":"nothri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-27T09:00:09-07:00","id":1068698,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nothri</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1067337-cocaine-left-in-the-hedge?p=1068375#post1068375\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;All right, all right. Enough of the screaming. 'Oh, there's a hobgoblin in my room! Help! Help!' If I wanted to eat your face, I'd've done it when you slept, you shrill voiced idiot. So no more of that! What I need you to do now is take this vile thing you just left to plague us! Take it and leave us in peace? Do you know what this did? DO YOU? My mate, Galthrag, he went and took a sniff of this vile stuff, he did. Looks dazed a sec, then looks around all squinty like and declares 'This makes no sense'. Next thing I know, Galthrag is goin around calling himself 'Bob' wearing a suit like and all. Quites ambushing folk in the wood to skin em alive. Now he spends his daze in the mortal world, sitting at some infernal mortal machine 'accountingating' or some such madness. Comes back with a loaf of what he insists is bread, except this stuff is ground up grain and not the bones of dead english men. Just the other day he's in the gob market trying to buy a trinket, and I keep tellin him the price is three whispers of a spider sung to mortal child as it dreams. And he blows up at me, waves some exotic looking green mortal paper in my face with pictures of numbers and old buildings and some dead mortals on em and insists he use that to pay. And I tells him the price is the price, and he demands to see my 'manager' whatever in the Fairy that is, and when I says we don't have none of those he says that he'll see me in court. He knows damn well I don't trek none with the Changeling Courts and he shouldn't be mucking in their affairs none either! You take it back! Driven him mad, you have!&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> It makes Hobs go sane?! BWAAAAA HA HA HA HA!!! That's hilarious!<br /> <br /> Oh sweet hedge thorns, what happens to other drugs? I can't think of anything that doesn't sound a bit like this<br /> <br /> Maybe Hedge pot makes you incredibly hyper and in the moment?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":7920,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","user":"Master Aquatosic","date":". 03-27-2017, 12:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-27T11:12:58-07:00","id":1068761,"title":"","content":"It should sink into the ground and grow a Cocaine tree, which produces bricks of snortable Super-Cocaine Goblin Fruit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2309-ashenrogue","name":"Ashenrogue","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1388"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-27T11:27:48-07:00","id":1068768,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ashenrogue</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1067337-cocaine-left-in-the-hedge?p=1068761#post1068761\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It should sink into the ground and grow a Cocaine tree, which produces bricks of snortable Super-Cocaine Goblin Fruit.</div> </div> </div> </div>Goblin <i>leaves</i>... I'd say it'd require prep work of a fae with Goblin Healing to work on mortals, perhaps in the form of crystallized sap which is then smokable.<br /> <br /> As far as affects, they should be amazing and plot worthy, increased Strength, Dexterity, Presence, and Stamina but causes Persistent Deprivation when not under its affects. Perhaps it'd cause an aura of power that can be seen as a mien that even morals get while under its affects, mortals with a mien are bad news for sure...<br /> <br /> Never mind it attracts a True Fae with the title &quot;The Interventionist&quot;...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i>\u201cYouth ages, immaturity is outgrown, ignorance can be educated, and drunkenness sobered, but stupid lasts forever.\u201d </i>~ <b>Aristophanes</b><br /> <i>&quot;Virescit Vulnere Virtus&quot;</i> ~ <b>Stewart Clan Motto</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Frailty Chronicles</a></span><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">;</a><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Understanding the power of limitations.</a></b></div>","edited":{"userid":3279,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","user":"Pale_Crusader","date":". 03-27-2017, 02:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","name":"Pale_Crusader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"841"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-27T16:04:09-07:00","id":1068920,"title":"","content":"And suddenly, I'm thinking of <a href=\"http://channelawesome.com/at4w-new-guardians-2/\" target=\"_blank\">Snowflame</a>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10118-bronzedog","name":"BronzeDog","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"239"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-27T16:05:25-07:00","id":1068922,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BronzeDog</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1067337-cocaine-left-in-the-hedge?p=1068920#post1068920\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And suddenly, I'm thinking of <a href=\"http://channelawesome.com/at4w-new-guardians-2/\" target=\"_blank\">Snowflame</a>.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> &quot;Cocaine is my <b>GOD</b> and I am the white hot instrument of its will!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-28T05:39:41-07:00","id":1069266,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lord Jub-Jub</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1067337-cocaine-left-in-the-hedge?p=1067560#post1067560\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd imagine something like this.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/37CmQTFJ090\" target=\"_blank\">https://youtu.be/37CmQTFJ090</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you for that!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4045-princeofcincinnati","name":"princeofcincinnati","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4045_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"95"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-28T05:42:42-07:00","id":1069267,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HelmsDerp</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1067337-cocaine-left-in-the-hedge?p=1067502#post1067502\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It depends on how long the cocaine is left there. The usual course of events is that items left in the Hedge eventually become tokens, but there aren't anything like solid rules for how long it takes or what effect the token has. Especially as a limited use item it's less likely to become a token with a dot rating as opposed to a trifle (essentially a limited use 0 dot token)<br /> <br /> Another important question, how well did they hide it? There's every possibility of it being consumed by a hobgoblin or winding up in a merchants stall at goblin market.<br /> <br /> If you just want to apply a magical property, I would suggest that it ensorcells mortals, allowing them to see through Masks for a week. Changelings already react poorly to many kinds of drugs, it would probably inflict a nasty clarity breaking point.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Long story short, the changeling in question opened a portal to the hedge from an open police car, near a haunted house. You asked. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4045-princeofcincinnati","name":"princeofcincinnati","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4045_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"95"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-28T05:56:22-07:00","id":1069269,"title":"","content":"Did anyone else hear &quot;snortable fear toxin&quot;? <br /> <br /> Also, was it a house haunted by ghosts or a haunted house attraction?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-28T11:59:50-07:00","id":1069520,"title":"","content":"<div cla